<title>USA: PreventCo enters joint venture.</title>
<headline>PreventCo enters joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PreventCo Inc said on Friday it has entered a joint venture with the American Foundation for Drug Prevention Inc for PreventCo's development and marketing of a drug detection and deterrence program for schools.</p>
<p>The company's Drug Free School PAK that includes awareness materials and use of the 800 help/info line will be sold directly to schools for $499.95, PreventCo said.</p>
<p>Every school district in the U.S. will be targeted for the purchase of the Drug Free School PAK, PreventCo said.</p>
</text>
